.TH RO-CONTROL 1 "September 2026" "ro-control 1.3.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ro-control \- NVIDIA driver manager, cooling controller, and hardware diagnostics suite for Ro-ASD
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ro-control
[\fICOMMAND\fR] [\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ro-control
provides the central hardware management desktop application and command-line
utility developed for Ro-ASD. It manages NVIDIA drivers, fan cooling profiles,
power limits, and real-time system telemetry.
When no command is provided, the graphical interface is launched.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B help
Print usage information.
.TP
.B version
Print the application version.
.TP
.B status
Print a concise system and driver status summary.
.TP
.B diagnostics
Print a full diagnostics snapshot.
.TP
.BI "driver install " [ "--proprietary" " | " "--open-source" ] " [--accept-license]"
Install the NVIDIA driver stack. The proprietary path is the default.
.TP
.B driver remove
Remove installed NVIDIA packages.
.TP
.B driver update
Update the installed NVIDIA driver.
.TP
.B driver deep-clean
Remove legacy NVIDIA leftovers.
.TP
.B fan status [--json]
Display fan telemetry, RPM, current mode, and hardware capability.
.TP
.BI "fan set-speed " "<0-100>"
Manually set the target fan speed percentage.
.TP
.BI "fan set-mode " "<auto|silent|balanced|performance|manual|custom>"
Set the active fan cooling profile.
.TP
.BI "fan set-smoothing " "<on|off> [ramp_up] [ramp_down] [hysteresis]"
Configure fan smoothing and dynamic ramp rates.
.TP
.B fan reset
Restore default automatic hardware fan control curve.
.TP
.B power status [--json]
Display GPU power draw, default and current TDP limits, and persistence state.
.TP
.BI "power set-limit " "<watts>"
Set the GPU power limit in Watts (within hardware min/max bounds).
.TP
.BI "power set-preset " "<eco|balanced|performance|custom>"
Apply a predefined or custom GPU power preset.
.TP
.BI "power set-clocks " "<core_mhz> <mem_mhz>"
Set GPU core and memory clock offsets in MHz.
.TP
.BI "power set-persistence " "<on|off>"
Enable or disable NVIDIA driver persistence daemon mode.
.TP
.B processes [--json]
List active compute and graphics processes running on the GPU.
.TP
.BI "kill-process " "<pid>"
Terminate a GPU compute process by process ID.
.TP
.B gpus [--json]
List all detected GPU devices and active index.
.TP
.BI "select-gpu " "<index>"
Select active GPU device by index for multi-GPU systems.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show help text and exit.
.TP
.B \-v, \-\-version
Show the application version and exit.
.TP
.B \-\-daemon
Run headless background daemon with native D-Bus IPC service.
.TP
.B \-d, \-\-diagnostics
Legacy alias for
.BR diagnostics .
.TP
.B \-\-json
Render
.BR status ,
.BR diagnostics ,
.BR power ,
.BR fan ,
or
.BR processes
output as JSON.
.TP
.B \-\-proprietary
Use the proprietary NVIDIA driver install path.
.TP
.B \-\-open-source
Switch to the community open-source graphics driver path.
.TP
.B \-\-accept-license
Confirm that the NVIDIA license has been reviewed for the proprietary install path.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Command completed successfully.
.TP
.B 1
The requested driver management operation failed.
.TP
.B 2
Invalid command line usage or unsupported option combination.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B ro-control status
Print a concise text summary.
.TP
.B ro-control diagnostics --json
Emit a machine-readable diagnostics snapshot.
.TP
.B ro-control driver install --proprietary --accept-license
Install the proprietary driver stack with explicit license confirmation.
.TP
.B ro-control driver update
Update the installed NVIDIA driver.
.TP
.B ro-control fan status --json
Print machine-readable fan telemetry and mode status.
.TP
.B ro-control fan set-mode performance
Engage performance cooling mode for high compute workloads.
.TP
.B ro-control fan set-speed 75
Manually fix fan speed to 75%.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/bin/ro-control
Installed CLI entry point.
.TP
.I /usr/share/man/man1/ro-control.1.gz
Manual page.
.TP
.I /usr/share/bash-completion/completions/ro-control
Bash completion definition.
.TP
.I /usr/share/zsh/site-functions/_ro-control
Zsh completion definition.
.TP
.I /usr/share/fish/vendor_completions.d/ro-control.fish
Fish completion definition.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR pkexec (1),
.BR dnf (8)
